description	"Rebel Assault Rifleman

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (1)
- A-280 Blaster Rifle (3)
- PLX-1 Rocket Launcher (1 Rocket)
- 2 Pulse Grenades

^8Attributes:
- 2 Reinforcements

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]

These Elite Forces are a match for even the most trained Imperial Defense Forces. Flexible enough to take out an enemy Tie Fighter, and accurate enough to pick of Womp Rats from back home even from space. Beware of their pulse nades sabotage skills."